235ee9a2-05fb-4af6-bb12-2ce06ef95e3e	privacy-policy	1	{"body": "<p>At MyYajmaan, privacy is important to us. This policy explains how we handle information when you browse our services, create an account, book a puja, or contact our team. 1. Information We Collect We collect information you share when you create an account, book a puja, contact support, or use our services. This may include your name, email address, phone number, billing details, booking information, and messages sent to our support team. 2. How We Use Your Information We use your information to provide and improve our services, confirm and manage bookings, process payments, communicate important updates, provide customer support, prevent misuse, and comply with legal obligations. 3. How We Protect Your Data We use access controls, secure connections, and appropriate technical and organisational measures to protect personal information. No online service can guarantee absolute security, so please protect your account credentials and contact us if you notice unusual activity. 4. Sharing Your Information We share information only when needed to provide the service, such as with the selected Pandit Ji, payment providers, technology partners, or authorities where legally required. We do not sell your personal information. 5. Cookies and Tracking Technologies We may use cookies or similar technologies to keep you signed in, remember preferences, understand service usage, and improve the experience. You can manage cookies through your browser settings. 6. Your Data Protection Rights Depending on applicable law, you may request access, correction, deletion, restriction, or a copy of your personal information. Contact our support team to make a request and we will respond within a reasonable period. 7. Third-Party Links Our service may contain links to third-party websites or services. We are not responsible for their privacy practices, so please review their policies before sharing information. 8. Children's Privacy Our services are not intended for children under the age of 13, and we do not knowingly collect personal information from children. 9. Changes to This Privacy Policy We may update this policy from time to time. The updated version will be posted on this page with its effective date. Continued use of the service after an update means you accept the revised policy.</p>", "title": "Privacy Policy", "description": "How we collect, use, protect, and respect your personal information."}	2026-09-04 11:41:21.727092+00	3549a83c-d1b0-45ae-a0f3-998d6c955163
e5e9887a-d784-4e65-9c94-6ec8a6ccfb4a	privacy-policy	2	{"body": "<p>&lt;article class=\\"mx-auto mt-6 max-w-4xl rounded-[1.8rem] border border-amber-100 bg-[#fffaf2] p-5 shadow-[0_18px_40px_rgba(122,31,45,0.06)] sm:p-8 lg:p-12\\"&gt;&lt;p class=\\"text-sm leading-7 text-slate-600\\"&gt;At MyYajmaan, privacy is important to us. This policy explains how we handle information when you browse our services, create an account, book a puja, or contact our team&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=\\"mt-7 space-y-7\\"&gt;&lt;section class=\\"border-b border-amber-100 pb-6 last:border-b-0\\"&gt;&lt;h2 class=\\"font-serif text-xl font-semibold text-maroon sm:text-2xl\\"&gt;1. Information We Collect&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p class=\\"mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-600\\"&gt;We collect information you share when you create an account, book a puja, contact support, or use our services. This may include your name, email address, phone number, billing details, booking information, and messages sent to our support team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/section&gt;&lt;section class=\\"border-b border-amber-100 pb-6 last:border-b-0\\"&gt;&lt;h2 class=\\"font-serif text-xl font-semibold text-maroon sm:text-2xl\\"&gt;2. Who Can Use MyYajmaan&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p class=\\"mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-600\\"&gt;You must be at least 18 years old and able to enter into a binding agreement to register as a customer or a Pandit Ji. Information you provide during registration must be accurate and kept up to date.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/section&gt;&lt;section class=\\"border-b border-amber-100 pb-6 last:border-b-0\\"&gt;&lt;h2 class=\\"font-serif text-xl font-semibold text-maroon sm:text-2xl\\"&gt;3. Bookings and Payments&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p class=\\"mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-600\\"&gt;When you book a puja, you agree to pay the listed amount (plus any applicable coupon adjustments or fees). Bookings are subject to Pandit Ji availability and confirmation. Reschedule and cancellation fees, where applicable, are shown before you confirm the action.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/section&gt;&lt;section class=\\"border-b border-amber-100 pb-6 last:border-b-0\\"&gt;&lt;h2 class=\\"font-serif text-xl font-semibold text-maroon sm:text-2xl\\"&gt;4. Pandit Ji Registration and Conduct&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p class=\\"mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-600\\"&gt;Pandit Ji accounts are subject to admin review and approval before becoming visible for booking. Pandits are expected to conduct services professionally, arrive as scheduled, and keep their profile, pricing, and documents accurate.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/section&gt;&lt;section class=\\"border-b border-amber-100 pb-6 last:border-b-0\\"&gt;&lt;h2 class=\\"font-serif text-xl font-semibold text-maroon sm:text-2xl\\"&gt;5. Wallet and Referral Rewards&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p class=\\"mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-600\\"&gt;Wallet balances, signup bonuses, and referral rewards are provided at MyYajmaan's discretion and may be adjusted, capped, or withdrawn in cases of misuse, fraud, or abuse of the referral program.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/section&gt;&lt;section class=\\"border-b border-amber-100 pb-6 last:border-b-0\\"&gt;&lt;h2 class=\\"font-serif text-xl font-semibold text-maroon sm:text-2xl\\"&gt;6. Cancellations and Refunds&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p class=\\"mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-600\\"&gt;Cancellation and refund terms are shown at the time of cancellation and may vary based on how close to the scheduled puja the request is made. See our Cancellation &amp;amp; Refund Policy for full details.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/section&gt;&lt;section class=\\"border-b border-amber-100 pb-6 last:border-b-0\\"&gt;&lt;h2 class=\\"font-serif text-xl font-semibold text-maroon sm:text-2xl\\"&gt;7. User Conduct&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p class=\\"mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-600\\"&gt;You agree not to misuse the platform, submit false information, impersonate another person, or interfere with the normal operation of the service. We may suspend or terminate accounts that violate these terms.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/section&gt;&lt;section class=\\"border-b border-amber-100 pb-6 last:border-b-0\\"&gt;&lt;h2 class=\\"font-serif text-xl font-semibold text-maroon sm:text-2xl\\"&gt;8. Limitation of Liability&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p class=\\"mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-600\\"&gt;MyYajmaan facilitates connections between customers and Pandit Jis but is not responsible for the religious, ritual, or personal outcomes of a puja. Our liability is limited to the amount paid for the specific booking in question.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/section&gt;&lt;section class=\\"border-b border-amber-100 pb-6 last:border-b-0\\"&gt;&lt;h2 class=\\"font-serif text-xl font-semibold text-maroon sm:text-2xl\\"&gt;9. Changes to These Terms&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p class=\\"mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-600\\"&gt;We may update these Terms and Conditions from time to time. The updated version will be posted on this page with its effective date. Continued use of the service after an update means you accept the revised terms.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/section&gt;&lt;section class=\\"border-b border-amber-100 pb-6 last:border-b-0\\"&gt;&lt;h2 class=\\"font-serif text-xl font-semibold text-maroon sm:text-2xl\\"&gt;10. Contact Us&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p class=\\"mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-600\\"&gt;If you have questions about these Terms and Conditions, please reach out to our support team via the Contact Us page.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/section&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class=\\"mt-2 text-xs text-slate-500\\"&gt;Last updated: 29 August 2026&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/article&gt;</p>", "title": "Privacy Policy", "description": "How we collect, use, protect, and respect your personal information."}	2026-09-04 12:02:28.037514+00	3549a83c-d1b0-45ae-a0f3-998d6c955163
